<title>THAILAND: Siam Makro pays 1.30 baht div for 1996.</title>
<headline>Siam Makro pays 1.30 baht div for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.30	  vs	 1.15</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 31, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Thailand's Siam Makro Plc is a discount store operator.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
